       "  'Annual debt service (£000)\\nNew term loan, Terms = 7.00%; requested: 7 years amortising; recommended: 6 months interest-only, then 84 months amortising. New term loan, As requested = 371. New term loan, As recommended = 325. Existing Northbridge term loan, Terms = £600k, 5 years remaining, fixed 6.50%. Existing Northbridge term loan, As requested = 144. Existing Northbridge term loan, As recommended = 144. Hire purchase (third party), Terms = Contractual. Hire purchase (third party), As requested = 85. Hire purchase (third party), As recommended = 85. RCF £500k, Terms = Interest at 7.50% on 50% assumed utilisation. RCF £500k, As requested = 19. RCF £500k, As recommended = 19. Total debt service, Terms = . Total debt service, As requested = 619. Total debt service, As recommended = 573\\nThe annuity factor for 7 years at 7.00% is 0.07 / (1 - 1.07⁻⁷) = 0.1856, so £2.0m → £371k and £1.75m → £325k a year.',\n",
